{"title":"아인 [단행본]","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=eWHji/dJMb9WL5nx4/q9BkjAGEkey6SFWy9kLZm1&filename=th3","synopsis":"17년 전, 아프리카의 전장에 죽지 않는 인간이 나타났다. 그 후, 드물게 인류에 나타나는 결코 죽지 않는 미지의 신생물을 인간은 「아인(亞人)」이라 불렀다.\n여름방학 직전, 한 일본인 고교생이 하교길에 교통사고를 당해 즉사. 되살아난 소년에게는 거액의 상금이 걸렸다. 그리고 전 인류를 상대로 한 소년의 도피행이 시작되었다. \nⓒTsuina Miura, Gamon Sakurai/Kodansha Ltd./ⓒGamon Sakurai/Kodansha Ltd.","topComments":[{"author":"홍진우","date":"26.08.04","text":"수작","episode":"아인 17권","likeCount":"좋아요","replyCount":"댓글 달기"}],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":197,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-21","rank":300,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-28","rank":192,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-29","rank":211,"change":{"type":"down","amount":19}},{"date":"2026-09-03","rank":190,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-09","rank":237,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-17","rank":257,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}}],"weekly":[{"date":"2026-08-29","rank":266,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-30","rank":262,"change":{"type":"up","amount":4}},{"date":"2026-08-31","rank":270,"change":{"type":"down","amount":8}},{"date":"2026-09-01","rank":247,"change":{"type":"up","amount":23}},{"date":"2026-09-02","rank":248,"change":{"type":"down","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-09-03","rank":221,"change":{"type":"up","amount":27}},{"date":"2026-09-04","rank":268,"change":{"type":"down","amount":47}},{"date":"2026-09-07","rank":296,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-09","rank":243,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}}],"monthly":[]},"viewSeries":[],"metricsSeries":[{"date":"2026-10-07","v":1159,"rc":19,"rs":190,"cc":1}]}